# Kept as a tombstone, not as a list.
#
# This file used to name the sources xgettext should scan. Every entry was a
# GTK file -- pdfarranger/pdfarranger.py, data/menu.ui -- and phase 5 deleted
# all of them, so the list described a program that no longer exists.
#
# The template is generated instead, by walking the package:
#
#     python tools/update_pot.py
#
# Nothing reads this file. It stays so that a translator arriving from
# upstream, where POTFILES.in is the convention, is told where to look rather
# than left wondering why the list is empty.
